ed weapon is automatically reloaded after a short period of time."},{"name":"Supercharged Magazine","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b17b5725c96e59f838ae045b8433f8df.png","desc":"While amplified, ammo is gradually transferred from reserves to the magazine. \n\nWhile in Speed Booster, ammo regenerates faster and overflows the magazine."},{"name":"Jolting Feedback","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/27270b6f5da035b05fa797c82bb6a10d.png","desc":"Dealing repeated damage with this weapon inflicts Jolt. \n\nWhile amplified, Jolt is applied faster."},{"name":"Rapid Hit","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/de22847fa94634a487758041887bcdaa.png","desc":"Rapid precision hits temporarily increase stability and reload speed."},{"name":"Light Touch","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/46b000a4e8c4ffa73df16c26a63360e0.png","desc":"This weapon gains reload speed, handling, and aim down sight speed when you are amplified, radiant, or have Devour."},{"name":"Rangefinder","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/74270d52bec24f1f5f4c987f5f37fce9.png","desc":"Aiming this weapon increases its effective range and zoom magnification. Increased projectile velocity while aiming Rocket Launchers, Grenade Launchers, and Bows."},{"name":"Turnabout","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/02786692ea8de976f059b01b4450a67e.png","desc":"Using this weapon to break the shield of a combatant or a Guardian using their Super will grant you an overshield."},{"name":"Well-Rounded","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/29d63faf15876cf3a9a382aa857b608b.png","desc":"Throwing a grenade or hitting a target with a charged melee grants a stacking bonus to weapon stability, handling, and range.\n\nUsing a Super grants maximum stacks."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Firing Line","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/92a5e8dbef32a414709d3196cb815d89.png","desc":"This weapon deals increased precision damage when near two or more allies."},{"name":"Vorpal Weapon","icon":"/common/desti